Z||000002||Tryxalon||06-28-2001||02:23 PM||||Please read the topics and articles here: <BR> <A HREF="http://www.homestead.com/Fiero2M4/IronDuke.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.homestead.com/Fiero2M4/IronDuke.html</A> <P>130 HP is about the max sustainable reliable horsepower from the Iron Duke with a total rebuild!!  It is an economy engine - was designed so, and made that way. <P>SD4 is a racing engine version from the same source (a sexy cousin) with different heads and totally different block and crank. <BR> <A HREF="http://www.gtsonline.com/krp/prod1.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.gtsonline.com/krp/prod1.htm</A>  <P>||||reg||1
